{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Kz3nVsuJmYS3wNGTVeLFYm","type":"tool_result","content":"pub fn app_params_with_100_bits_security(log_stacked_height: usize) -> SystemParams {\n    assert!(\n        log_stacked_height <= MAX_APP_LOG_STACKED_HEIGHT,\n        \"log_stacked_height must be <= {MAX_APP_LOG_STACKED_HEIGHT}\",\n    );\n    SystemParams::new(\n        DEFAULT_APP_LOG_BLOWUP,\n        DEFAULT_APP_L_SKIP,\n        log_stacked_height.saturating_sub(DEFAULT_APP_L_SKIP), // n_stack\n        2048,                                                  // w_stack\n        WHIR_MAX_LOG_FINAL_POLY_LEN,\n        5,  // folding pow\n        15, // mu pow\n        WhirProximityStrategy::UniqueDecoding,\n        SECURITY_BITS_TARGET,\n        log_up_security_params_baby_bear_100_bits(),\n    )\n}\n\n/// Returns `SystemParams` targeting 100 bits of proven RBR security for leaf aggregation circuits.\n///","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01UbyFWThQ3j4E9HCHZBPdc7","session_id":"8773bab9-c899-4b31-8324-e4269b1a66cf","uuid":"2d58e12a-173b-498d-8784-1330e6ada00b","timestamp":"2026-04-15T22:36:12.716Z"}
